&lt;p style="margin-left: 132px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -60px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
